  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5901.62 Medical direction",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5901.62 “Medical direction” means on-line or off-line direction by the medical resource hospital physician or designee and on-line direction from the receiving hospital’s physician or designee to EMS personnel.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at Chapter heading for Saf-C 5900) #12790, eff 5-24-19",
